# Kept out of the image: everything that is not needed to build or run.
node_modules
.next
.git
.github
.vercel
spike
design inspiration
.env*
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# `tests/` stays: `next build` type-checks lib/*.test.ts, which import the
# in-memory Redis from there, so excluding it fails the build.
# `assets/` stays too: the share-card routes read font files from it, at
# build time and again whenever one is rendered on demand.
